# Project Management API

A REST API for project and task management with authentication, role-based access control, project ownership/membership authorization, JWT access tokens, refresh-token rotation, and automated tests.

This project was developed as an internship assignment focused on **authentication, authorization, API design, code quality, and testing**.

The implementation uses **FastAPI, SQLAlchemy, SQLite, Alembic, Pydantic, and JWT-based authentication**.

