FastAPI automatically generates OpenAPI documentation.

After starting the application:

```text
Swagger UI:
http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs

ReDoc:
http://127.0.0.1:8000/redoc
```

The Swagger UI can be used to inspect endpoints, request schemas, response schemas, authentication requirements, and execute API requests during development.

