## Assignment Notes

This implementation prioritizes the core goals of the assignment:

1. Correct authentication
2. Correct role-based authorization
3. Correct resource ownership/membership authorization
4. Centralized access-control logic
5. Secure token handling
6. Input validation
7. Automated testing
8. Clear project structure
9. Database migrations
10. API documentation

The implementation intentionally avoids adding unnecessary features that would increase complexity without contributing to the core requirements.